            'leftovers held by docker) — a bare rm -rf failing the checkout '
            'was the gh-1600 trigger',
      );
      expect(
        action,
        contains('stale-workspace'),
        reason:
            'a still-blocked remainder must move aside into \$RUNNER_TEMP '
